WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
- All hail the Beam.

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:04.375
All hail the Beam.

00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:06.166
- You may be benched.

00:00:06.166 --> 00:00:07.916
Worshipers of the Beam,

00:00:07.916 --> 00:00:11.875
it has been my pleasure to shepherd in a triumphant new era,

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:15.666
where, with every victory, the Beam grows stronger.

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:17.416
- All hail the Beam.

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:20.708
- Tonight, we shall summon the Almighty Beam,

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:24.458
allowing us to blot out the Western sky with its beauty.

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:28.791
Never again will Sac Town be thrust back into darkness.

00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:30.166
[Alarm buzzing]

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.333
An intruder!

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:33.916
It can’t be...

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.208
- The prodigal son has returned!

00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:38.583
Tyrese!

00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:41.125
- I’ve come to shut off that damn Beam!

00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:46.250
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.666
♪♪♪ Riaru-sa misetayo ♪♪♪

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:52.541
♪♪♪ Born to be a legend ♪♪♪

00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:55.916
♪♪♪ Hikari o mezashite ♪♪♪

00:00:55.916 --> 00:01:02.708
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.416
[Phone ringing]

00:01:11.416 --> 00:01:14.541
- [Hield:] You ready for that sweet revenge?

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.583
- [Haliburton:] I’m just focused on passing right now.

00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:17.916
But yes!

00:01:24.666 --> 00:01:25.750
- Brother Haliburton!

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:27.708
Have you come to embrace the Beam?

00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:32.833
That’s rude.

00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:33.583
Very well.

00:01:33.583 --> 00:01:36.708
- Beam, grant us the power of the pistol offense.

00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:41.291
Dang corner shooters.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:43.541
Buddy!

00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:50.083
- Haha! No one shoots faster than me.

00:01:54.291 --> 00:01:56.041
- Wait, I'm new.

00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:57.750
I don't know what I'm doing!

00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:01.458
- I'm getting too old for this.

00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:04.416
I’m too young for this!

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:08.500
- Nothing like homemade Red Velvet.

00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:19.666
- Now we summon the Almighty Beam.

00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:21.291
- [Haliburton:] You’re in my spot.

00:02:21.291 --> 00:02:22.625
- It’s Haliburton. Run!

00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:26.833
- There are no spots in the eyes of the Beam.

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:27.416
[Gong]

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:32.083
- Look into the Beam, Tyrese!

00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:32.791
- Never!

00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:33.708
[Beeping]

00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:35.458
- [Fox:] No!

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:51.416
- Yo.

00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:53.500
- The...Beam?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.250
- I go by many names.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.166
Some call me the Almighty Beam.

00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:59.208
Some call me stupid and ironic.

00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:01.833
I hear you've come to destroy me.

00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:02.541
Why?

00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:05.458
- I...wanted revenge for being cast out...

00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:07.833
and to prove to everyone I’m not a fake hero.

00:03:07.833 --> 00:03:10.041
- Wally Szczerbiak is everyone now?

00:03:11.416 --> 00:03:13.166
You were a hero here.

00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:15.708
And you are a hero in Indiana-opolis.

00:03:15.708 --> 00:03:19.416
Just because the beam shines doesn't mean you don't shine.

00:03:19.416 --> 00:03:22.625
You need to...find your own beam.

00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:24.625
- Find my own beam.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.250
[Ringing]

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.500
- [Hield:] You ready for that sweet revenge?

00:03:31.041 --> 00:03:32.875
Where are you going?

00:03:33.541 --> 00:03:35.250
- That’s someone else’s problem.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.916
Let’s find our own beam.

00:03:37.916 --> 00:03:40.166
- I was not expecting that answer to be that deep.

00:03:40.166 --> 00:03:41.083
You good, bro?

00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:53.250
- The Beam from the north is too powerful!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.750
We must offer up a sacrifice to protect the cap!

00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:01.083
- Oh, whoa! Whoa! Wait!

